cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use π-MSNet or the MSNetLoader package in your research, please cite this software record and the accompanying paper."
title: "π-MSNet: A large-scale, AI-ready, continuously reprocessed proteomics data portal"
abstract: >-
  π-MSNet is a large-scale, AI-ready portal for computational proteomics. Mass
  spectrometry datasets from public repositories and in-house projects are
  reprocessed with a uniform identification and quality-control workflow into a
  standardized QPX Parquet representation, giving a continuously updated resource
  for training, benchmarking, and developing machine learning models in
  proteomics. This record covers the analysis code and the MSNetLoader Python
  package; the datasets themselves are archived as a separate record (see
  references below).
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-26"

repository-code: "https://github.com/PHOENIXcenter/pi-MSnet"
url: "https://msnet.ncpsb.org.cn"

keywords:
  - "proteomics"
  - "mass spectrometry"
  - "machine learning"
  - "deep learning"
  - "MS/MS spectrum prediction"
  - "retention time prediction"
  - "de novo peptide sequencing"
  - "QPX"
  - "Parquet"

